            <div xml:id="m-1feed4e5-d2c7-41b7-b7c7-544b840a0027">
              <lg xml:id="m-f4a44913-d39f-448d-b405-b63b2c842f29">
                <l xml:id="m-c68255da-2b4f-4ef1-827a-89f24f882a66" facs="#m-b543f1d3-ba84-4788-bb40-d976ad82bd71" label="ambiguous">710</l><l xml:id="m-8d21776a-c63f-44c0-8da2-8115119a736b" facs="#m-bf805594-69fc-437a-b553-9c7402af0c5e" label="ambiguous">Good Friday</l><l xml:id="m-87824fbd-c3b9-42e8-9fe6-525183916ab0" facs="#m-3becad14-69b1-4d8b-b29f-1f6cbc86104c" label="text-like">Or:</l><l xml:id="m-d7bbfd6a-98b4-4544-ac68-484d248b9cab" facs="#m-5b83430d-ec12-4062-8507-911f1dfba7a3" label="lyrics-like">V. Locú-ti sunt advérsum me língua</l><l xml:id="m-b0c37cdc-6f96-481a-9fce-f2eb7c48215a" facs="#m-91d4525a-f8c6-44d4-8254-29ac22f2f1d8" label="lyrics-like">do- ló-sa.</l><l xml:id="m-ea601b91-2667-4b12-85eb-916435152d75" facs="#m-dc9e37e4-b2a9-4abf-9e14-acbdf12ed1c6" label="lyrics-like">R. Et sermónibus ódii circumdedérunt</l><l xml:id="m-2a2e369a-5a2f-4564-b58d-bd6ecb020e81" facs="#m-042279d7-1efa-420d-b260-8d0b5c62055b" label="lyrics-like">me, ] et expugnavérunt me gra-tis.</l><l xml:id="m-9cd2fa5a-4249-487f-a747-67deb70b8bae" facs="#m-a148c6c7-cf24-4e6c-886c-8306c3ca53b0" label="ambiguous">Pater noster. in silence.</l><l xml:id="m-45cb5e59-e13f-4dd8-b766-d3832339aec4" facs="#m-38bdf345-5f99-44bf-acf4-e1febdc0dca5" label="lyrics-like">De Epistola beáti Pauli apóstoli ad Hebraéos</l><l xml:id="m-4b947cfd-382e-4f04-b13f-5093f1d789bf" facs="#m-ab1fdfa6-ed74-4fb3-822d-03ef8e0e9d0d" label="ambiguous">LESSON VII</l><l xml:id="m-d8295c30-dbb8-4144-9cef-16157fe9eda8" facs="#m-9cd430cf-36c4-4586-a703-011752bfbb77" label="ambiguous">Chap. 4, 11-16 et 5, 1-10</l><l xml:id="m-482125e4-bfaf-4aee-bf91-72e20c7f672e" facs="#m-26f51591-95f1-4289-b8c8-8add626c07b6" label="lyrics-like">Estinémus ingredi in illam bilis in conspéctu ejus: ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-277fad87-3e13-4e71-8d32-dbd4049427a7" facs="#m-1c8a17c6-e85d-411f-9e3b-8bfd0982434a" label="lyrics-like">réquiem: ut ne in idípsum</l><l xml:id="m-ea4481f7-dc87-48bf-812d-452199611885" facs="#m-e7c00b39-fff4-4fc3-836a-e30e5a7d13b3" label="lyrics-like">autem nuda et apérta sunt óculis</l><l xml:id="m-5138a82a-3130-4778-a95b-425bca633a4f" facs="#m-ea45b739-4ebe-44b1-8045-e9d4da3285e1" label="lyrics-like">quis incidat incredulitátis exém¬</l><l xml:id="m-37d9ccdf-da01-4ee9-810d-49bb399f2fa8" facs="#m-e63836cb-a779-4df8-be14-aa1d195d7e26" label="ambiguous">ejus, ad quem nobis sermo. Ha¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd90927e-530d-4909-9c59-f7ef2e80d588" facs="#m-a3bbdbab-b3d3-4519-8fba-34aec7f853ca" label="lyrics-like">béntes ergo Pontificem magnum,</l><l xml:id="m-b306c854-6ef2-4e6b-96ba-0a5b7701c5b5" facs="#m-c187a164-5115-488b-85f3-d8e261fad7d1" label="ambiguous">plum. Vivus est enim sermo</l><l xml:id="m-29caa714-422e-4b97-8ff4-77f57e3265f9" facs="#m-056b2a83-bd90-4ed2-9740-960e5ee29f99" label="lyrics-like">Dei, et émcax, et penetrabslior</l><l xml:id="m-f6cb6211-c3ee-48ce-baa0-3ee4ac13483f" facs="#m-01c42d24-d9b9-4060-81c8-204ad34e20f3" label="lyrics-like">qui penetrávit caelos, Jesum</l><l xml:id="m-bb621df6-f8c7-46ed-9d2f-e40176fc7832" facs="#m-e7c43565-9aec-4548-836f-5cd1897f3c88" label="lyrics-like">omni gládio ancipiti: et pertin¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5e4ac02-3088-48b0-b5df-d495419e2054" facs="#m-31971878-38da-423a-bfa4-b2c7034e1248" label="lyrics-like">Fslium Dei: teneámus confessió¬</l><l xml:id="m-2567d8a0-79a7-408d-80f9-f9d64bcb4d8f" facs="#m-391cea59-715b-4bb7-b096-d36fda378f1c" label="lyrics-like">nem. Non enim habémus Ponti¬</l><l xml:id="m-7980cad8-dcba-45f4-930f-ef2387795315" facs="#m-b98c9081-8c0f-413a-9590-5c5efc4dde7c" label="lyrics-like">gens usque ad divisiónem ánimae</l><l xml:id="m-b6f9667a-19d0-4a23-9cd6-d3e706d8421b" facs="#m-adaef2eb-0e6a-4485-8bf6-10cf11824234" label="lyrics-like">ficem qui non possit cómpati</l><l xml:id="m-9689b85e-a352-4d94-a197-88f02676327e" facs="#m-7e31c4f0-c3cf-4d09-ba16-bab0f3e4e3ea" label="lyrics-like">ac spiritus, compágum quoque</l><l xml:id="m-31dcec49-7dc5-4087-ba9e-c23da4dfe1bb" facs="#m-762225f5-f2c5-4b33-b2e8-f4e880fa0357" label="lyrics-like">infirmitátibus nostris: tentátum</l><l xml:id="m-fe373f31-b2f9-40b5-a3d0-022323d72d96" facs="#m-f6104937-63d3-44dd-9a7e-69988e55a4a2" label="lyrics-like">ac medullárum, et discrétor cogi¬</l><l xml:id="m-610f545e-3c1b-423e-a2db-7a96d8b9d646" facs="#m-3c663cf8-2c80-4fe3-8ac4-9da9b32f77fb" label="lyrics-like">autem per ómnia pro similitúdine</l><l xml:id="m-ec5260e8-6cd6-407a-83e1-73d0042493fe" facs="#m-1fd4b0c0-682b-45e4-8843-77dd7ec013e3" label="lyrics-like">tatiónum et intentiónum cordis.</l><l xml:id="m-18e11d13-d741-49a1-be51-49ee493679ed" facs="#m-a72d4a84-6124-43f0-8586-0e20926eb743" label="lyrics-like">Et non est ulla creatúra invisi- absque peccáto.</l><l xml:id="m-b756cf2e-f342-4497-a7b6-dde2896863c7" facs="#m-0a4b4099-4df8-479e-80e2-ae92a61aef7e" label="ambiguous">nesp.7</l><l xml:id="m-0570cdd2-d09d-4404-8db3-b736cde5ab4a" facs="#m-be93de43-544e-4891-98b5-91068411f138" label="lyrics-like">Radidé- runt me</l><l xml:id="m-bc225af3-9431-421e-bbcb-cb45f66a673a" facs="#m-31184c94-e123-458e-b241-41ac8ad7960d" label="lyrics-like">in mánus impi¬ </l><l xml:id="m-41bdc9e0-04b0-4367-a12a-743914ab1f64" facs="#m-13fd03a1-3eba-4284-ba23-25c1da67879b" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-e716bb74-3d08-41e0-8be9-df33a5acfb47" facs="#m-6e7f0d97-a998-4182-9fec-a75e6cb3dbbd" label="lyrics-like">rum, et inter in-i- quos pro-je¬ cérunt me,</l><l xml:id="m-5d2ce3e1-7263-4d38-b4f7-9a4e066b5e05" facs="#m-8c35266c-5bc2-4213-a1c2-953ad7771342" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-e630586b-ff48-43e6-9dd0-dc3b1afcc438" facs="#m-bb36d924-74a3-42de-a114-ce706c8922d7" label="lyrics-like">non peper-cé¬ runt áni¬ mae mé¬ ae: congregá¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d50214f-fec5-4dab-848f-7343ecf2175e" facs="#m-fd344335-1574-46c6-ae2d-18bc786e57a5" label="lyrics-like">fór-tes:</l><l xml:id="m-09490796-94d3-4767-b153-e9b967351971" facs="#m-0b818f01-ef54-4102-bea6-d23864da7ec1" label="lyrics-like">ti sunt advérsum me</l><l xml:id="m-7ddda89a-47fc-4f36-9025-e4267e056886" facs="#m-32601269-b0b1-4e99-a218-536e3a06b9e5" label="lyrics-like">Et sic-ut gi-gán¬</l><l xml:id="m-3de1f0ce-3da6-4224-a257-f7425ac63be8" facs="#m-686b9171-d225-4e2d-b169-7cca32861c6c" label="lyrics-like">V. A-i-é¬</l><l xml:id="m-2574f6fb-7092-44f2-a907-0409fc8703fe" facs="#m-0c89d7ef-436c-410e-8e45-3d81a87eb473" label="ambiguous">tes</l><l xml:id="m-ea1c80e8-90df-4262-8bf8-07d5132639d2" facs="#m-1f14466e-adc0-478c-8932-e230c0003da2" label="lyrics-like">ste-té- runt</l><l xml:id="m-0ce53775-7743-4c6d-b82d-a214704f3ec2" facs="#m-c8d50f7b-4fc4-4f1e-bb74-815cc465f429" label="ambiguous">me.</l><l xml:id="m-3bdfdca2-b600-4436-b86b-f4201c185a5f" facs="#m-c4768666-637b-4eba-a501-decc32d00c66" label="ambiguous">contra</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
